'''Vanilluxe''' (Japanese: '''バイバニラ''' ''Baivanilla'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

