==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BREAKthrough|Vanilluxe|45}} from the {{TCG|BREAKthrough}} expansion.
*'''Double Spin''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Lt. Surge's Voltorb|84}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

